    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n4 Gandon House is a bright and well-presented two-bedroom apartment positioned on the second floor of this highly sought after development, Custom House Square, in the heart of the IFSC with countless amenities at your doorstep. Additionally benefiting with a designated car space. \n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hall with storage, a spacious living/dining room that benefits from a communal garden aspect, a well-appointed kitchen off the dining area. There are two double bedrooms with built in wardrobes, and a fully tiled bathroom. Completed with a spacious balcony south facing with street views. \n\nLocated in one of Dublin's most popular areas with an array of local amenities in the vicinity including shops, restaurants & cafes, as well as a host of international businesses located in the IFSC and Grand Canal Dock. O'Connell Street and Grafton Street are both within a short walk, while transport around the city and beyond is catered to with easy access to both the Red & Green Luas lines, Connolly Station, Dublin Bike stations, and a wide selection of bus routes."
      },
